# Copy to .env.local and fill in.
#
# FDraft itself needs nothing here to run — it's local-first (see
# docs/product-spec.md, "REMOVE UNNECESSARY REMOTE INFRASTRUCTURE"). The one
# optional value below only enables film metadata enrichment.

# Optional. When unset, imported films are stored with no metadata and can
# be enriched later once this is configured (see "Settings" -> "Metadata" in
# the app, and src/domain/import/providers/configured-provider.ts) — the
# honest outcome when no authorized metadata provider is configured, not an
# error. Get a free key at https://www.themoviedb.org/settings/api. Used
# server-side only, by src/app/api/metadata/route.ts — never sent to the
# browser.
TMDB_API_KEY=

# Only needed to run scripts/export-supabase-data.ts, a one-off migration
# tool for pulling data out of an OLD, EXTERNAL Supabase project that ran a
# pre-9.5B version of this app. Not read by the running app itself.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
# SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY=
